{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "type": "string",
  "description": "The specific error, one of a closed set of Port OS codes. Every REST error body, MCP tool error, batch item error and discovery item error uses this enum; each code belongs to an `ErrorFamily` that decides its HTTP status. Provider-specific codes are never codes: they travel in `details.providerCode`. New failure kinds are added here, never as free strings.",
